MANUAL_ONLY=true
TITLE=E2E-82: OSS Program — sponsored review on a granted public repo
TAGS=oss,billing
MODE=dynamo
BODY=Grant the fixtures repo via scripts/grant-oss.ts on an installation with an exhausted free tier and zero balance, then confirm a PR is reviewed with no free-tier or balance consumption, sponsored-cost counters move, unnamed repos stay gated, private flips stop sponsorship, renames don't, and revoke degrades to the free tier. Needs a dedicated installation state — do not run in the shared suite. No fixture PR.
